A||||1||wjluciano||notch back to fast back conversion||||1||
Z||000000||wjluciano||03-26-2001||03:52 PM||||ok over the week end I made the conversion. Let me tell you It was alot easier than i thought. <P>tools needed 7mm, 8mm ,10mm phillips and flat head screw driver and one 6 pack of miller i would suggest a 12 pack but you really dont want to wake up in the mornign and find that you put a fast back where your front end was.<P>things to do <P>1)drop headliner and remove the retaing bolts to the roof and the notch back (10mm)<P>2) remove rear side panles <P>3) remove trunk lid, vents and sail panles<P>4)remove taillights<P>5) and remove gas plate<P>6) remove the panles that cover your seat belts there is a bolt behind each one that need to be removed<P>7) remove inside panles behind the sail oanles <P>8) remove the bolts that are behind the tail lights, on the top deck and wheel wells <P>9) remove rear side markers and drill the rivets out <P>10 she is ready to come off<P>you should have someone help you set the fast back on. Its alot earsier to line up<P>If you have an 86 modle the wireing for your trunk lid powere release will route the same. earlier modles the wireing drops on the left side of the engine and would have to re routed.<P>Pop of your gutter moldings and replace them with the ones from the fast back then bolt up in reverse.<P>things to do while converting <P>This is a good time to put some new under coating, new headliner and repaint all those hard to get to parts. I also steamed the engine<P>now your trunk will change from a oval type to more of a rectangle you will need new weather stripping and the half moons from the fast back aslo you will be changing the mounting brackets for the vents. remember to get the longer tailight screws and change your trunk lock before shutting it luckily i had hooked up the power release.<P>If you are keepomg your se bumpers the will take a slight trimming by the wheel well. I diid the hole conversion by myself for the first time plus changed the headliner in 5 hours i could of saved a half our if i didnt misplace my ten mm<BR>||||reg||1
